{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1530,
  "batch_count": 1703,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "e986962879d48100c079e1a81335b9de9e25b281",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ddd8da62eeaaf66b04d363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新入生歓迎会だろ、花見だろ、\r\nあとドロワにチーム歓迎会…\r\nいやぁ、宴だらけで最っ高だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3617caa6d20d50f3d4e28e3eaded95c850988e34aff850e600cd6dc17f46413c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a0c3b2d9b7bf4269d254405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エースに頼んで、盆踊りを教えて\r\nもらったんだ！今度祭りにも連れて\r\n行ってくれるってさ！Awesome!",
      "source_fingerprint": "e336bbb3769f06dd343869f5e936d77037251abfc495456c6c3307b5535cbeba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38eb6e153fe1870320c858d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イチョウ並木を歩くのが好きでさ。\r\n金色でお宝の道みたいだろ。いつか\r\n本物の金であれの再現をするのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c5d0221167df273774ffe06c3dc89165b2bb3a5973d317f8a193b05e0e9c37b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa897d5954a9c2772fcffb0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本には、入ったら最後、誰も彼も\r\n眠って黙っちまう道具があんだろ？\r\n…KOTATSU、恐ろしい罠だ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c383d1e73c926f9a8bdde7a033a84f7a2543c0230beead51b0e36ee13c29c58a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed764f27148ffd9263052b93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0ec480eb1c205f2ee4177f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘリオスは最高のRoommateさ！\r\nミラーボールとDJ機材持ち込んで\r\nずっとバカ騒ぎしてくれんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cce04c122f81c79bf27d460bcfd59fabd4d8334055b5cd483f0db888ba087128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7d2143b0bf4e8598d88e54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エースとスカジャンってやつを\r\n買いに行ったんだ！お揃いで着てさ\r\n最高にcoolな写真が撮れたよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e5e7dfb6f17a19ce7e8637b1baf1a6d155a46cb9fdeb5b391da8a9a53a3dd9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68e69438acaf73de39e97565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスエスとは話している時より、\r\n踊っている時のほうが通じ合うね。\r\n情熱がビシビシぶつかってくるんだ",
      "source_fingerprint": "341c84ac115a72b6ec68b9ddc6dffa5e4a6bf530bddea31b3c3e524331400c2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b95a3348c709f4cc0293509c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アキュートの雰囲気、なんとなく\r\nうちのグランマに似てるんだよな…\r\n安心するってか、和むってか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeaee81be82af34949f6ed48f3da7693b3f8fe5d6759ffaa03cd309ae8ee26dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eca65f5f716d87607d3acad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシは1人っ子なんだけど、\r\n全く寂しくはないね。broやsis\r\nみたいなヤツらばっかだからかな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3799e2337dcac0809783e5b418d3a06a32d9968a29d37d28f66ebdd6af7ea17f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d61ecbaf7964943b6d1963b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園に来て、まずもらった衣装が\r\nコレでさ。嬉しくて踊りまくって…\r\n汗のせいで翌日にはクリーニングさ",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b23ccf188f39ff797e15a2615372d56c23c0179c26ee4bf6a05f07f71538c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7877e06de673f2d5bbe51172",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お揃いの衣装を着て、同じステージ\r\nで歌い踊る！ライブ中はさ、この\r\n時間よ、ずっと続けって思うんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae36214db865706381573b2c31224d8ac49d3dcd7497bcbcb67faafbc79b7d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1394c39483e5f21687c23f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "踊るように生きて、欲しいもの\r\n全部掴む！そんなアタシの生き様を\r\nこの勝負服と共に刻んでやるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccd547f0e18c0ca5938e486d0083b684e7b20b3e12a231ed0ac4802ac80aa2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b61893baab0dbf51f76702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライブでもこの衣装はよく映える\r\nんだ！ママの舞台衣装を参考に\r\nしたのさ。ダンサーっぽいだろ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af487a43fde100f33a5c2799e133af4376825e79a2a15dc1eb2c63935d33328",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8b68ae8b1bf618034f7c68d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘリオスはご機嫌な太陽さ！\r\n『おっはよー！』ってひと声で\r\n眠気もヒュンと逃げていくんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7310332f6688891c98cce97047d8b70c9b47c37b15de2a27ea0428f36c89341a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3148cef24172660549d301fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスレッスンの先生とは\r\n個人的にもよく話すんだ。新しい\r\n振付けの感想を聞かれたりするよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25f15617b157f1c950d6af3e991c5045a85bf572aaf577fcb08d138ad570707f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dec5992541b07fb0b89c3807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユニヴァースも夜空を見上げては、\r\n遥か遠くに想いを馳せてるんだと。\r\n…ロマンだよな、わかるぜ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9581911f4eecee77ac6b3f92e70ee6540307e10c139e5167a48e184925a75c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c0e293c0f44bcf2d3bf9c3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ついつい料理を作りすぎるんだが、\r\nそういう時は全部弁当にするんだ！\r\nで、花見さ！宴し放題、最高だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b253490a436338ef011988637471a523aaca16cc2ed7fc44431ae3eb87ce4b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a576d0b027dfb32258c2650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつか…氷の城を購入して…\r\n夏はそこで宴を開いてやるんだ…！\r\nこの暑さは…それまでの辛抱…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96511ed765e787a1511b21220d7e52565839c9f975720eaa2eda47035e92dee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:650e65bc02eec3550e5d45d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロブロイと本の話で盛り上がってさ\r\n宝探しの冒険に、英雄と仲間の絆！\r\nアイツが語るロマンに胸が躍ったよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6190a67a4937f57624541cde82dcd965fa1d8028ed74b7ff042efea04aea5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42d152245ef47f2c7424018",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシの故郷じゃ、池が凍ったら\r\nみんなで滑りに行くんだ。近所の\r\nチビにも教えてさ…元気かな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81582d16c821073272f17be4c21751d6c699339a73805ff7d59113590b1b7954",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc9a2b4f322645a67ae9b71e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK、準備はできてる！\r\n今日もいいリズムを刻んでやるさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f2b901c54ddf67cbee172ea64cb9843ec3f7bec3c592e45c1636a7f17dea18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40bd8b40bdf204798e43153a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さ、やるか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad35cf98bd75fa3f832aec08bfff509bdb7118639423c77ab04e496903b5d5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fccc4e5d89bde9e95c374a97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "考える役目はアンタに任せる！\r\nアタシはただ、\r\n全力で思うがまま走るだけだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0692a89ce8b6b07cc2a30887bf6d6dc898eea426410274a12cc79303991dda56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b794f8b4a1c008522434fa30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、今日のトレーニングも\r\n楽しもうじゃないか！ここに2人が\r\n揃ったんだ、いい時間を過ごそうぜ",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b9e29ccb56f64357447454ab6dc11cf49affe65fff23a914d8ef285d268e74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441c632e45dd54ee75c19c86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wow、もう走っている奴らがいる\r\nじゃないか！乗り遅れるわけには\r\nいかないぞ、アタシたちも行こう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa6571b4585552fcfff7956c63bea6ed77a7ece20a52014e5eda4d2314444a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52cbe093fe9940601f81ea2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日のアタシはツイているんだ。\r\n自販機のスロット、7が揃ってさ！\r\n1本やるよ、Happyのシェアだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e037fb176793b5df55a8ff33189a679d9c04d4e6afa799be9d78fcb46783291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3ba8c7a799bc99e33fbd243",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有名になってさ、スポンサーが\r\nついたらCM依頼とかもくるよな？\r\nそうしたら一緒に出ようぜ！ハハッ",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d686105081c7987f0d3574d7ec150db8a116dce9330b6ad28770f72af3bd27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70f62c65de5602fc57e2afa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界一の夢が叶ったら、次は何を\r\nしたい？何でも言ってみろよ、\r\nアンタの想像以上を見せてやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb40d2a23867f46feda372027588444dea8a62aad5562af746a5737b2a44fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f65e89ed21d9862cf4d204e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "せっかくの合宿だ、もっとヒート\r\nアップしよう！太陽をステージ\r\nライトに、楽しもうじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bf13add9166ac663e968876e535ca2da1808445738685fc9dd13961d35b781",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7675393a64b0093a9938c44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これからも一生、一緒にバカ騒ぎしよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45bc38e855f97d5c542fef9c55e98ebbdef7eec302426c4cbc4568e88f8567cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112bdaf615df5de6e810d576",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシたちの旅路に…乾杯っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1919dae19ed0e262cb98b797be288056dc91a24ce846465e72c72be3d2157f9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1066d318643231c40adcf9a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ステップに磨きがかかったぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad5b6e100ed41e7736893c3c1d8b4919793d808d478ebbb6d65d1c39bc4eb75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:880061803b909ddef7eff4da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと沸かせてやるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4747160de7d508b2e5aae367a0100c74d6091389baae0b8416ed61ccb4e5f63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:445e7a73d0221bdbd0249826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK、タップダンスシチーだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ea81825173037a109932257fa73f91ad41753254b46bb1abc982f48afa9a18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ca99248a5b729c639eaae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一生終わらない宴で\r\nアンタも笑って暮らそうぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac98dfd1f434a9e6ddfb1672eb0b436e958702a54185f05a12ed5f43928265b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5999069af89a01a963d30c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もう一肌脱いでやるか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c8564667af31e9cf1749201b43b6bf66cde984abf3aa1102f1535ba3af19cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6740da3cb1cabcf19625c47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、リードされたいのは誰だ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a84000f4982cf6fc0e97258d86edc3003263c71e96f9d29d94b26fe6c93eff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f46b6c8e733280e754e405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c963e152abff7e182db29d21b6dd64d75a237557c55784c43388e18d8c803d5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317f53c78383f6e758248574",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到抵达最强的，那一天。\r\n希望你多告诉我，\r\n那些我尚未看见的自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcbdf79cf6cdcd99e0bd0896d6626523ab56b851c9b61ee6f5f5c2771d04aa80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c58d222475b747a1adf615a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97947257c9cc4d99fa74f52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11a60ba3c42e7b25eea1ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使，称不上完美――\r\n也只需继续前行。\r\n……我想昂首挺胸地走下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9e99e3401f2bc0bec4bffee224d64f313df4546e0cd8e4ee19c74208054d45a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b59fd18a9dd672f3301668c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………。\r\n……不。只是觉得\r\n你现在，也在我身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "454d61c3620c60acbaf004fa3e933454f84637be73797656d05d84a3cc24af48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b6f935a6b1f6c93aa70011b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "擅长速度的、擅长技巧的……\r\n家族中最强的最强会在\r\n新年决定。在板羽球大赛上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3b879690d990a37ee0b7e2195a5786c31b11f0d8384d4b9077ed1ae7476dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acec417db119ee5b4d80adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给送我巧克力的人回赠大豆饼干。\r\n同时摄取豆类中的维生素E，\r\n效果会更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f66041f38321b8d7efab0b99279775322dc497666961e8119207cff171d73a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bcfdcead0de451cb61acd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备了可可含量70％的巧克力。\r\n虽然苦味较重，\r\n但抗氧化作用很好。……辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81b1c8fc4c53135e1416d3620a3c8ec6bee1c6b5f1f6cb676d33f6e527f5c3ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d97d13a3f6e5f24b10e09d4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年，我都会在许愿笺上祈愿家族\r\n健康平安。\r\n……只要能实现，就足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c6897d89d3b7e4b4b35d40df8e76313250cf6d276784ca1ea7247e0b5ba38b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82f4b54b6a82590b471dae9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果，灵魂真的\r\n存在……我想邀请过去伟大的\r\n赛马娘，一起并跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d740e357b5be8c44b97e2057a03b0d7f37bf3206a4cf35e7955176da23f004c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692d17dbbaca119017ba4d63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们全家把圣诞节定为饮食放纵日。\r\n禁止计算蛋糕的热量。\r\n父母也会笑着阻止我",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e927baddfb78df598ea4d940e54bd7edd7b232e89edf1977060b4e1e39ec87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98fa9727d003f82881713c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微，出去走走如何？……听说巴黎的\r\n大街也十分华丽。\r\n今天似乎能，感受到那样的氛围",
      "source_fingerprint": "bac9955103130f1d39eb7fcf3d01f097b0f98abb60909d4468ae99e360c8422e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf92984564d7b2f45b3cd3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理所当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40e949f5a51abdea07d1f36453852492c5e1dcf81dc08d8f70cb0826e984f694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c0fb5194f4e7f8cdfe46345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说年末年初很容易长胖。\r\n我想了些简单的运动。你的目标\r\n是消耗2000千卡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3414d82e01cfb8418bbffb3607b265880beee4b47d748f62a7a3e4819ee290a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c615a48277994691a6bf7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你，今天过生日吧。生日快乐。\r\n我准备了亲戚经营的健身房邀请券。\r\n这次由我来担任训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08406cb513d0522204999832eff767ef9b8f1569b643009b9462b2637438deca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90032106b99119e5fbf6b7ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……说实话，我很少给别人送礼物\r\n所以有些苦恼。\r\n怎样做，你才会高兴？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95dffd621c6f83a8ab06d734aff970fc62ab83516481e89ec57dac986232a3fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2603c8ba73dec958d7f31e8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐们寄来了礼物。\r\n以王冠为主题的，钢笔和手套……\r\n我要注意做出与之相称的举止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb12747cf146d60cad1c0aa6ebf3d57a18976e70611a0431caff243736da7ed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a6e3d4ac43f580458d63160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要的东西……能占用你的时间\r\n吗。我想为今后的典礼\r\n……订做一套，与你相配的衣装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28dc1d5194edbed9235a753df212e15fe4191a34cf8f35b2a73ed78e0af23378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce7cbf91f6d9f3f6ee7ae63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知。\r\n最好尽早确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "226e530c44f05ceb5de3fcbe6b6fbebdb94de9a397b9480bebb98eb8c6bbc9a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7277a0269b76c570bb8d413",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到了给你的礼物。\r\n建议你领取。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1adfe3168b370c7c6a2db9838c4bf29bc5af4261f926541a57666581fe3e62f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de816d66b158031f3326f240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有已经完成的任务。\r\n自己达成的成果，应该\r\n准确掌握。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c63a34e2384ad6c233a4dce6d8665cd47ffa303326de5cff6bb2bb1af4c5854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c89b2c7aba30d31ae21230",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有活动。\r\n我认为可以考虑参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d060b8c4680fa743e17f6b147d82904013e30ffa0dda0e59b4080e683efff84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a578bf6096d8d6d92e37a608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办。\r\n去活动现场，露个面\r\n也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade37819a4483dde91adb8f74494c30836c4f7b656707e3a4df591ed12374ced",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2470f3a47268eee7301acc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……吸取教训吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9903eadb6fbc5c5b04631736a7ca392e18b019fbc9609b7d0744ec74b16aa814",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc1560ebf46304575c8c9f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级似乎提高了。\r\n最好准确掌握自己的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a2213317492d9770985e82addabd2c4bd254b0a98cd3f4bf5476980c95157d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f67c5dba196671abb121c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的私服多是运动品牌的，因为弹性\n和速干性都很好，可以直接进行\n一些简单的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38cf81061ca7f01b4066f5ddd687a24548d8fa91e7d89190b029b9caf929891a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70f18eab65100368518af84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么时候、在任何情况下，\n我都不会失去仪态。我一直注意\n让自己在别人眼中也无可羞愧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90383046fbfafe6bc6e85a24018f63fff773dc1e369f7cbf4b44e5d5a73becbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb429ac61a00f98d509d73a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽姐曾经教过我化妆……  \n在她帮我上红色眼影的时候，\n我非常紧张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9114e8b2d9e14d34d5590626308ac0e6f8752a61a800b930e60523adc6633e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41e5d48a2c37438e2e25da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实力相当，吗――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a01768081954aa115e2a0112491470a7b4a9ad55c752a6c619743c32bf16a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f746f721fa34ad355145035",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为是最强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7fc130417ce0ad5a38cc3ab6be09ca7338488b4199fff2e4b36133bf3f69027",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f56e037b1985f66ebc4088e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……吸取教训吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9903eadb6fbc5c5b04631736a7ca392e18b019fbc9609b7d0744ec74b16aa814",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1c392f3971d49dce4f5fd93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实力相当，吗――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a01768081954aa115e2a0112491470a7b4a9ad55c752a6c619743c32bf16a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20eb7eda6111a45895b59a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分刷新了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcbd654253cda31579be70bdc2b04abee0d1e8f168c2ceb27d3c6da06d45bb6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35d4726f81713ef8191f0095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂野地，前进――",
      "source_fingerprint": "89db2fb30b6bbc2ced11a77be8876453c006df809085aeb26bca93a3d2563269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d2fa40a584400f65f9764f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4a92dcb582f2dfde4c8841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练吗？\r\n好，先仔细准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbe05855f3f7c95b5a099200e998b8bc958d8d6d9b10b8afb7fe36b6973a31d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58618fcdad115702c9bc9d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过去的荣耀，故事――\r\n我想成为有资格继承它们的自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c3e678d9d5798ec86eb1513be06319b41faec32bd2154be437f4b0a74bee034",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4e10e74b94c22727d535787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名比赛吗。\r\n试试――平日锻炼的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6928a556d97af9d6cdb263117f4d78b4d69805168d44bcf96b67837d746ed486",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cec94ff4a8f4ad354564c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0367503e517de5ef4ab3290121cc093a038be4b190e2ab5f9461723f2af12312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c3e73587ff18c2604a0430",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与“女帝”同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d15ca61c3b4201614bf67b0db8bf7435772454b72ce4d84e31ac74ed949f2f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95a86c91e6bf45b5de02d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "12"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
